  "limitations": [
    "The power/reset bring-up and the DCS command-table player execute in an emulator over authored state; the regulator enable, bus config, reset-line set, delay, DCS write and logger are supplied. The write stub captures the real init bytes from the firmware descriptor, so the init DCS stream is verified, but no rail, reset line, bus or panel is driven.",
